% Map entries that connect the TeX Live "zhmetrics" metric files (uniyou20,
% unisong20, gbkyou20, ...) with the glyph files this image installs under the
% Windows file names those metrics expect (simyou.ttf, simsun.ttc, ...).
%
% zhmetrics ships metrics only, and its map lines live in the TeX file
% zhwinfonts.tex, which a document has to \input itself.  The lines below are
% the pdfTeX lines of that file - with the leading `=', which is a \pdfmapline
% modifier and not map file syntax, removed - installed into the system map by
% the Dockerfile, so that documents using these fonts work without having to
% know about zhwinfonts.tex.  See fonts/README.md.
gbk@UGBK@ <simsun.ttc
gbksong@UGBK@ <simsun.ttc
gbkkai@UGBK@ <simkai.ttf
gbkhei@UGBK@ <simhei.ttf
gbkfs@UGBK@ <simfang.ttf
gbkli@UGBK@ <simli.ttf
gbkyou@UGBK@ <simyou.ttf
cyberb@Unicode@ <simsun.ttc
unisong@Unicode@ <simsun.ttc
unikai@Unicode@ <simkai.ttf
unihei@Unicode@ <simhei.ttf
unifs@Unicode@ <simfang.ttf
unili@Unicode@ <simli.ttf
uniyou@Unicode@ <simyou.ttf
gbksongsl@UGBK@ <simsun.ttc
gbkkaisl@UGBK@ <simkai.ttf
gbkheisl@UGBK@ <simhei.ttf
gbkfssl@UGBK@ <simfang.ttf
gbklisl@UGBK@ <simli.ttf
gbkyousl@UGBK@ <simyou.ttf
unisongsl@Unicode@ <simsun.ttc
unikaisl@Unicode@ <simkai.ttf
uniheisl@Unicode@ <simhei.ttf
unifssl@Unicode@ <simfang.ttf
unilisl@Unicode@ <simli.ttf
uniyousl@Unicode@ <simyou.ttf
